NOTICE REGARDING SAMTTS_NATIVE (Software Automatic Mouth):

The directory `sam/samtts_native/` contains a vendored port of the Software Automatic Mouth (SAM) program.
The original SAM software was published in 1982 by Don't Ask Software (now SoftVoice, Inc.).
The status of the original software is currently considered Abandonware.
As such, the files within `sam/samtts_native/` are NOT covered by the MIT license above, but are provided "as is" under the concept of Fair Use. Use it at your own risk.